front matter (line 2): "title = \"Why I walk to work\"\nvoice = \"marin\"\n"
start     "Why I walk to work"
paragraph "Every morning I leave the house at a quarter to eight. The walk takes twenty-five minutes, and it is the best part of my day."
paragraph "The best way to find out if you can trust somebody is to trust them."
paragraph "— Ernest Hemingway"
paragraph "I used to drive. The car was faster, but I arrived tired and irritable, and I rarely remembered the trip.\nWalking changed that. I notice the traffic seasons now."
section   "What changed"
paragraph "Three things, mostly:"
paragraph "I sleep better."
list-item "I think better."
list-item "I spend less on fuel."
paragraph "That's all — thanks for reading!"
heading 1 "Why I walk to work"
heading 2 "What changed"
